  "post_content": "<p>Hasta las 14 horas de este domingo, por la ma&ntilde;ana, y de 17.30 a 20.30 horas puede verse todav&iacute;a en el Centro de Empleo y Cultura de Onda la exposici&oacute;n de fotograf&iacute;a Caseta Marim&oacute;n. El lloc m&eacute;s bonic del Mont&iacute;.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/01/IMG_0934.jpg\" style=\"height: 320px; width: 480px\" /></p>\n<p>Componentes de l&#39;Agrupaci&oacute; Fotogr&agrave;fica L&#39;Art de la Llum han realizado un completo reportaje sobre el antes y el ahora de la Caseta Marim&oacute;n, tras los trabajos realizados por Pepe Peris y Pepe Mart&iacute;, &#39;los Pepes&#39;, y colaboradores.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expofotoscasetamarimon/img_0892.jpg\" alt=\"img_0892\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expofotoscasetamarimon/img_0899.jpg\" alt=\"img_0899\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expofotoscasetamarimon/img_0901.jpg\" alt=\"img_0901\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expofotoscasetamarimon/img_0902.jpg\" alt=\"img_0902\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expofotoscasetamarimon/img_0904.jpg\" alt=\"img_0904\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expofotoscasetamarimon/img_0905.jpg\" alt=\"img_0905\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expofotoscasetamarimon/img_0907.jpg\" alt=\"img_0907\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expofotoscasetamarimon/img_0909.jpg\" alt=\"img_0909\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expofotoscasetamarimon/img_0913.jpg\" alt=\"img_0913\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expofotoscasetamarimon/img_0916.jpg\" alt=\"img_0916\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expofotoscasetamarimon/img_0917.jpg\" alt=\"img_0917\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expofotoscasetamarimon/img_0918.jpg\" alt=\"img_0918\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expofotoscasetamarimon/img_0919.jpg\" alt=\"img_0919\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expofotoscasetamarimon/img_0920.jpg\" alt=\"img_0920\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expofotoscasetamarimon/img_0922.jpg\" alt=\"img_0922\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expofotoscasetamarimon/img_0926.jpg\" alt=\"img_0926\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expofotoscasetamarimon/img_0927.jpg\" alt=\"img_0927\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expofotoscasetamarimon/img_0934.jpg\" alt=\"img_0934\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/expofotoscasetamarimon/img_0937.jpg\" alt=\"img_0937\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
